{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"g-5","type":"group","x":0,"y":2000,"width":2380,"height":1300,"label":"Duelist"},
		{"id":"g-7","type":"group","x":0,"y":5040,"width":2380,"height":1160,"label":"Devotee"},
		{"id":"g-9","type":"group","x":0,"y":6300,"width":2380,"height":1120,"label":"Thief"},
		{"id":"g-8","type":"group","x":0,"y":4040,"width":2380,"height":900,"label":"Tinkerer"},
		{"id":"g-4","type":"group","x":0,"y":1040,"width":2380,"height":860,"label":"Bardic"},
		{"id":"g-24","type":"group","x":0,"y":15960,"width":2380,"height":780,"label":"Alignment"},
		{"id":"g-0","type":"group","x":0,"y":-1840,"width":2380,"height":740,"label":"Squire"},
		{"id":"g-1","type":"group","x":0,"y":-1040,"width":2380,"height":720,"label":"Tank"},
		{"id":"g-23","type":"group","x":0,"y":15160,"width":2380,"height":720,"label":"Origin"},
		{"id":"g-12","type":"group","x":0,"y":9000,"width":2380,"height":680,"label":"Unarmed"},
		{"id":"g-11","type":"group","x":0,"y":8240,"width":2380,"height":660,"label":"Theurgy"},
		{"id":"g-19","type":"group","x":0,"y":13160,"width":2380,"height":660,"label":"Dagger"},
		{"id":"g-10","type":"group","x":0,"y":7520,"width":2380,"height":620,"label":"Thaumaturgy"},
		{"id":"g-2","type":"group","x":0,"y":-240,"width":2380,"height":600,"label":"Soldier"},
		{"id":"g-6","type":"group","x":0,"y":3380,"width":2380,"height":560,"label":"Acrobat"},
		{"id":"g-17","type":"group","x":0,"y":12120,"width":2380,"height":540,"label":"Axe"},
		{"id":"g-15","type":"group","x":0,"y":11000,"width":2380,"height":540,"label":"Mass"},
		{"id":"g-14","type":"group","x":0,"y":10360,"width":2380,"height":520,"label":"Spear"},
		{"id":"g-3","type":"group","x":0,"y":440,"width":2380,"height":520,"label":"Courier"},
		{"id":"g-13","type":"group","x":0,"y":9780,"width":2380,"height":480,"label":"Sword"},
		{"id":"g-22","type":"group","x":0,"y":14720,"width":2380,"height":360,"label":"Crossbow"},
		{"id":"g-20","type":"group","x":0,"y":13900,"width":2380,"height":340,"label":"Flail"},
		{"id":"g-16","type":"group","x":0,"y":11660,"width":2380,"height":320,"label":"Shield"},
		{"id":"g-21","type":"group","x":0,"y":14320,"width":2380,"height":320,"label":"Bow"},
		{"id":"g-18","type":"group","x":0,"y":12760,"width":2380,"height":280,"label":"Hook"},
		{"id":"n-16-1","type":"text","text":"**[Aegis]** \nShields you wield do not have a reduced damage die from the Defensive property.","x":1000,"y":11680,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-16-0","type":"text","text":"**[Shieldbash]** \nWhen using a Shield, you can perform the Push and Trip Maneuvers with it.","x":20,"y":11680,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-16-2","type":"text","text":"**[Mirror Shield]** \nWhile wielding a Shield, if you Block all damage dealt to you, you can choose to have any excess amount dealt back to your attacker.","x":500,"y":11820,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-16-3","type":"text","text":"**[Blast Shield]** \nWhile wielding a Shield, you have Advantage (2) on the initial Contest against AOEs.","x":1000,"y":11825,"width":410,"height":114},
		{"id":"n-18-2","type":"text","text":"**[Disarming Sweep]** \nWhen using a Hook, you can perform the Disarm and Trip Maneuvers.","x":500,"y":12916,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-17-3","type":"text","text":"**[Pry Aside - Maneuver]** \nYou pull aside the target's defenses with your Axe; the target suffers the Unsteady Condition with Persist (1).","x":500,"y":12339,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-17-5","type":"text","text":"**[Executioner's Strike]** \nAs an Interaction, you can expend 1 AP to increase your Axes' critical range until the end of the round by 1.","x":500,"y":12500,"width":410,"height":140},
		{"id":"n-15-1","type":"text","text":"**[Stunning Blow]** \nWhen you roll a Critical hit against a target while attacking with a Mass weapon, they gain Dazed with Persist (#) with (#) being the damage dealt.","x":20,"y":11180,"width":410,"height":140},
		{"id":"n-15-2","type":"text","text":"**[Lethality]** \nAs an Interaction, you can expend 1 AP to increase your Mass weapon's damage die by a size until the next time you would attack or counter.","x":20,"y":11360,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"61e5d2e0d7c1e690","type":"text","text":"**[Rend Armor - Maneuver]** \nWhen using a Mass weapon, you can shatter the target's armor; their armor suffers the Damaged (1) Condition.","x":500,"y":11020,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-15-3","type":"text","text":"**[All-or-Nothing]** \nAs an Interaction, you can expend 2 AP to double the damage of your next attack with a Mass weapon.","x":1000,"y":11376,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"e40e3d9800de0cfc","type":"text","text":"**[Rend Weapon - Maneuver]** \nWhen using Mass weapon, you can shatter the target's weapon; their weapon suffers the Damaged (1) Condition.","x":20,"y":11020,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-17-0","type":"text","text":"**[Scour]** \nWhen attacking with an Axe and reducing a target to 0 HP, you may make another attack against a different target within range without expending AP.","x":20,"y":12140,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"7169d0e498a2155e","type":"text","text":"**[Wide Sweep]** \nWhen using an Axe, you can perform the Trip and Push Maneuvers with it.","x":20,"y":12355,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-18-0","type":"text","text":"**[Walking Stick]** \nWhen wielding a Hook, you are immune to the Unsteady Condition.","x":20,"y":12780,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-18-1","type":"text","text":"**[Shepherd]** \nWhen using a Hook weapon, you can perform the Push and Pull Maneuvers with it.","x":20,"y":12916,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-14-0","type":"text","text":"**[Thrusting Strike]** \nWhen attacking with a Spear weapon, you can spend additional (#) AP to increase your Reach by (#) for the rest of the round.","x":20,"y":10400,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-14-2","type":"text","text":"**[Impale]** \nWhen using a Spear, Defenders cannot benefit from Partially Covered.","x":20,"y":10587,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-14-4","type":"text","text":"**[Javelin Toss]** \nWhen throwing a Spear weapon you can move half your Speed towards the target after the attack.","x":20,"y":10740,"width":410,"height":122},
		{"id":"n-14-1","type":"text","text":"**[Set Spear]** \nWhile wielding a Spear, you can perform an attack against a target when entering spaces you Threaten.","x":500,"y":10400,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-14-3","type":"text","text":"**[Crucify - Maneuver]** \nWhen attacking with a Spear, you can crucify a target where they stand; they  suffer the Stuck Condition with Persist (1).","x":500,"y":10572,"width":410,"height":122},
		{"id":"n-13-3","type":"text","text":"**[Steel Lotus]** \nWhile wielding a Sword, you Threaten all spaces within your reach, even if you aren't Facing them.","x":500,"y":9992,"width":410,"height":114},
		{"id":"n-13-2","type":"text","text":"**[Compact Form]** \nWhile wielding a Sword, you are immune to the Cramped Condition and can Block while Unsteady.","x":20,"y":9988,"width":410,"height":122},
		{"id":"n-13-4","type":"text","text":"**[Hurricane]** \nYou can expend 3 AP to make an attack against every target within range of your Sword.","x":1000,"y":10004,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"38e519529503bb85","type":"text","text":"**[Flourish]** \nWhen using a Sword, you can perform the Disarm and Trip Maneuvers with it.","x":20,"y":10140,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-12-6","type":"text","text":"**[Vanishing Fist]** \nYou can still Evade while using your Heavy Unarmed weapons, and have Advantage (1) on all Maneuver Contests performed with them.","x":1460,"y":9216,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-12-2","type":"text","text":"**[The Art of Nine Limbs]** \nIf you expend 3+ AP on performing attacks with an Unarmed weapon, you can make another attack with an Unarmed weapon without expending AP.","x":1460,"y":9020,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-12-5","type":"text","text":"**[Steel Fist]**\nYour Unarmed weapons are treated as Heavy instead of Versatile, which deals 1d12 damage and requires both hands to be empty.","x":1000,"y":9216,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-12-8","type":"text","text":"**[Crushing Grip]** \nAt the start of your turn, you deal untyped damage to a target you are grappling equal to your Strength score.","x":1000,"y":9540,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-12-1","type":"text","text":"**[Pressure Point - Maneuver]** \nYou hit a specific point; the target suffers the Unsteady Condition with Persist (1).","x":1000,"y":9044,"width":410,"height":107},
		{"id":"n-11-1","type":"text","text":"**[Invocations II]** \nYou can commune with Entities and are able to invoke them with spells of Complexity (2).","x":500,"y":8260,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-12-7","type":"text","text":"**[Kick]** \nYou do not need a free hand to perform attacks with an Unarmed weapon, and your Unarmed weapons have Reach.","x":500,"y":9380,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-12-9","type":"text","text":"**[Burr]** \nWhen you are grappling a target, you may instead move whenever they move, including forced movement.","x":500,"y":9540,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-12-4","type":"text","text":"**[Iron Fist]** \nYour Unarmed weapons are treated as Versatile instead of Light, which have a base damage die of 1d8 which increases to 1d10 if both hands are empty.","x":500,"y":9200,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-13-0","type":"text","text":"**[First Blood]** \nThe first Wound you would leave with a Sword in an encounter is always Moderate.","x":20,"y":9832,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-11-3","type":"text","text":"**[Invocations IV]**\nYou can commune with Entities and are able to invoke them with spells of Complexity (4).","x":1460,"y":8260,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-11-4","type":"text","text":"**[Invocations V]** \nYou can commune with Entities and are able to invoke them with spells of Complexity (5).","x":1940,"y":8260,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-11-7","type":"text","text":"**[Vessel]** \nAs an Interaction, you can expend 1 AP to flood your body with your Entity's energy. This effect lasts as long as you choose to maintain it; for the duration you roll all spells with Advantage (1) and gain 1 Fatigue at the end of each of your turns. After gaining the Fatigue, you may choose to expel the energy.","x":1000,"y":8381,"width":410,"height":239},
		{"id":"n-11-6","type":"text","text":"**[Miracle]** \nOnce per encounter, when damage would reduce you to 0 HP, you remain at 1 HP instead. Ignore any excess damage.","x":500,"y":8377,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-12-3","type":"text","text":"**[Martial Arts]** \nYour Unarmed weapons are treated as a Light Unarmed weapon that uses Strength or Dexterity and targets Strength or Dexterity. This grants the increase to max AP provided by Light Weapons.","x":20,"y":9192,"width":410,"height":171},
		{"id":"n-11-2","type":"text","text":"**[Invocations III]** \nYou can commune with Entities and are able to invoke them with spells of Complexity (3).","x":1000,"y":8260,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-12-0","type":"text","text":"**[Throat Punch - Maneuver]** \nYou punch the throat; the target's word limit is reduced to 5 until the end of their next turn.","x":20,"y":9052,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-10-9","type":"text","text":"**[Spell Exemption III]** \nWhen you Cast a spell with an AOE, you can choose to ignore 5 targets.","x":1000,"y":7840,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-11-0","type":"text","text":"**[Invocations I]** \nYou can commune with Entities and are able to invoke them with spells of Complexity (1).","x":20,"y":8260,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-11-5","type":"text","text":"**[Censure]** \nAs an Interaction, you entreat your Entity to censure a target within Earshot, making a Willpower vs. Willpower Contest; on a failure, the word count of the target's spells are doubled until the end of their turn.","x":20,"y":8380,"width":410,"height":188},
		{"id":"n-7-2","type":"text","text":"**[Devoted]** \nOn taking this, choose a specific deity. You can cast only Invocations from your chosen deity, but gain twice as much Favor from their Acts of Favor. If you would ever surrender this, or gain Favor with another deity, you immediately surrender all Favor with the chosen deity and cannot regain it.","x":20,"y":8640,"width":410,"height":239},
		{"id":"n-10-8","type":"text","text":"**[Spell Exemption II]** \nWhen you Cast a spell with an AOE, you can choose to ignore 3 targets.","x":500,"y":7840,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-10-1","type":"text","text":"**[Equivalency II]** \nGain a Major Wound of your choice. You can create and Cast spells up to 10 Mana.","x":500,"y":7540,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-10-5","type":"text","text":"**[Iron Gate]** \nYou gain a bonus to DR against any spells or attacks targeting Willpower equal to the number of Major Wounds and Scars gained from [Equivalency].","x":500,"y":7660,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-10-2","type":"text","text":"**[Equivalency III]** \nGain a Major Wound of your choice. You can create and Cast spells up to 15 Mana.","x":1000,"y":7540,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-10-7","type":"text","text":"**[Spell Exemption I]** \nWhen you Cast a spell with an AOE, you can choose to ignore 1 target.","x":20,"y":7840,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-10-3","type":"text","text":"**[Equivalency IV]** \nGain a Major Wound of your choice. You can create and Cast spells up to 20 Mana.","x":1460,"y":7540,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-10-4","type":"text","text":"**[Equivalency V]** \nGain a Major Wound of your choice. You can create and Cast spells up to 25 Mana.","x":1940,"y":7540,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-10-10","type":"text","text":"**[Throw Wide the Gate]** \nWhen Casting, you can re-open Scars to increase your Mana maximum by 5 per Scar re-opened until the end of the encounter. You must heal these Wounds as normal.","x":20,"y":7960,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-9-8","type":"text","text":"**[Sticky Fingers]** \nYou can expend 1 AP to intercept a ranged Contraption that is targeting a space within Paces (5) of you. Make a Dexterity vs. Dexterity contest against the thrower; on a failure, their contraption is stolen and prevented from activating.","x":500,"y":6902,"width":410,"height":198},
		{"id":"n-9-2","type":"text","text":"**[Steal - Maneuver]** \nYou can expend 1 AP to rob a target, making a Dexterity vs. Dexterity Contest; on a failure, you steal one item that is not held or worn from their Encumbrance (ie, un-equipped Equipment).","x":20,"y":6650,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-9-7","type":"text","text":"**[Backstab]** \nWhen you attack a target while directly behind them, you deal double damage as if you had Critically hit.","x":1000,"y":7100,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-10-0","type":"text","text":"**[Equivalency I]** \nGain a Major Wound of your choice. You can create and Cast spells up to 5 Mana.","x":20,"y":7540,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-10-6","type":"text","text":"**[Untested Formula]** \nAs an Interaction, you can spend 1 AP on your turn to make 5 Mana worth of adjustments to a spell you can Cast for the duration of the encounter.","x":1940,"y":7660,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-9-6","type":"text","text":"**[Adrenaline Rush]** \nAs a free Interaction, you gain +2 AP during your turn. When you do, you suffer the Dazed Condition for Persist (2). You cannot gain this AP while you are Dazed.","x":500,"y":7240,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-9-3","type":"text","text":"**[Plant - Maneuver]** \nYou can expend 1 AP to reverse pickpocket an item onto a target, making a Dexterity vs. Dexterity Contest; on a failure, you can force an Equipment or Contraption of Bulk (1) into their Encumbrance, which they cannot drop until the end of your next turn. If the item is a Contraption, you can choose to have it activate at the end of your turn.","x":500,"y":6595,"width":410,"height":264},
		{"id":"n-9-1","type":"text","text":"**[Skullduggery - Maneuver]** \nYou can debilitate a target; on a failure, roll a 1d10, with the result being a Surface or Aggravated Wound on the Major Wound table. The target gains the Additional Effects of the Wound until the end of the encounter, but not the Wound itself. A target can only be affected by this ability once per encounter.","x":1460,"y":6320,"width":410,"height":240},
		{"id":"n-9-0","type":"text","text":"**[Pocket Sand - Maneuver]** \nYou can expend 2 AP to kick up sand into the eyes of a target; they suffer the Blinded (0) Condition with Persist (1).","x":500,"y":6379,"width":410,"height":122},
		{"id":"n-9-5","type":"text","text":"**[Ambush]** \nYou begin an encounter with maximum AP.","x":20,"y":7132,"width":410,"height":59},
		{"id":"n-7-9","type":"text","text":"**[Guardian I]** \nWhen an adjacent creature takes damage, you can split the damage they would take after factoring in their DR. This damage is untyped.","x":40,"y":5718,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-7-12","type":"text","text":"**[Rivalry]** \nYou can declare a rival at the beginning of an encounter, granting you Advantage (1) on your first attack against them each turn, but Disadvantage (1) when attacking anyone else. When your rival has exited the encounter, the Disadvantage (1) ends.","x":40,"y":5940,"width":410,"height":213},
		{"id":"n-7-10","type":"text","text":"**[Guardian II]** \nIf another creature suffers damage within 5 Paces, you can expend 1 AP to move adjacent to them and then trigger [Guardian I].","x":500,"y":5718,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-7-7","type":"text","text":"**[Inquisition]** \nWhen you have a visible trophy from a dead Kin in your Encumbrance, you deal 2 additional damage against a target from the same Kin.","x":500,"y":5985,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-7-5","type":"text","text":"**[Critical Condition]** \nWhen you suffer a Major Wound, the next attack you make is a Critical hit.","x":40,"y":5236,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-7-0","type":"text","text":"**[Vow of Poverty I]** \nYou gain +1 AP at the start of your turn whenever you don't have any Equipment in your Encumbrance.","x":500,"y":5056,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-7-1","type":"text","text":"**[Vow of Poverty II]** \nYou gain +2 AP at the start of your turn whenever you don't have any Equipment in your Encumbrance.","x":1460,"y":5056,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"d26afd5d75dd8dac","type":"text","text":"**[Wait for an Opening]** \nWhen you Wait, your next attack has Advantage (1).","x":40,"y":5540,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-7-4","type":"text","text":"**[Resurgence]** \nWhen you suffer a Major Wound, you become immune to all Conditions until the end of the next round, ending ones currently affecting you.","x":500,"y":5220,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-7-8","type":"text","text":"**[Patience]** \nWhen you Wait, you immediately gain an additional +1 AP.","x":500,"y":5540,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-7-3","type":"text","text":"**[Grit]** \nWhen you suffer a Major Wound, you make all d20 rolls with a +10 until the end of the next round.","x":500,"y":5380,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-8-6","type":"text","text":"**[Ballistician]** \nWeapons you are wielding gain the Thrown (10) property.","x":980,"y":4376,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-7-11","type":"text","text":"**[Guardian III]** \nYou can swear your loyalty to a Liege. When you are in combat with your Liege, you may do not need to expend 1 AP to move adjacent to them for [Guardian II], and can take full damage for them for [Guardian I]. You cannot change your Liege unless you are dismissed from their charge, they die, or you die.","x":980,"y":5660,"width":410,"height":239},
		{"id":"n-8-7","type":"text","text":"**[Re-Equip]** \nYou do not need to expend AP to draw or stow items.","x":20,"y":4540,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-8-3","type":"text","text":"**[Toolbelt]** \nThe first Interaction on your turn with a Contraption costs 1 AP less.","x":500,"y":4540,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-8-1","type":"text","text":"**[Grenadier II]** \nYour Spheres (#) are 1 larger, for a total of 2.","x":980,"y":4060,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-8-8","type":"text","text":"**[Strong Throw]** \nThe range of your Contraptions increases by Paces (5).","x":500,"y":4680,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-8-0","type":"text","text":"**[Grenadier I]** \nYour Spheres (#) are 1 larger.","x":20,"y":4076,"width":410,"height":59},
		{"id":"n-8-2","type":"text","text":"**[Grenadier III]**\nYour Spheres (#) are 1 larger, for a total of 3.","x":1940,"y":4060,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-8-4","type":"text","text":"**[Trauma Care]** \nAs an Interaction, you can expend 1 AP to use Medicine (#) to remove three times as much Bleeding (#).","x":20,"y":4180,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-8-5","type":"text","text":"**[Ricochet]** \nWhen you make an attack with a Thrown weapon, make an attack with the same roll against another target within range.","x":20,"y":4360,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-8-9","type":"text","text":"**[Safeguard]** \nEquipment you are wearing or wielding cannot suffer Damaged (#).","x":500,"y":4820,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-6-0","type":"text","text":"**[Steady Feet I]** \nEffects that would force you to move against your will move you half as many Paces.","x":20,"y":3412,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-6-4","type":"text","text":"**[Slip Past]** \nYou can freely move through any creature’s space.","x":500,"y":3572,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-6-6","type":"text","text":"**[Nimble Body]** \nWhen choosing to Evade, you may use your Dexterity for the Contest in place of Strength.","x":20,"y":3695,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-6-7","type":"text","text":"**[Break Out]** \nAs an Interaction, you can expend 1 AP to end the Tethered Condition on yourself.","x":20,"y":3820,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-6-5","type":"text","text":"**[Waylay]** \nWhenever you move through another creature's space for the first time on your turn, you can make an attack against them without expending AP.","x":1940,"y":3540,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-5-11","type":"text","text":"**[Offensive Stance]** \nAs part of a Pivot, you can assume or drop an offensive stance. You cannot Block or Counter; when you deal damage using your Strength or Dexterity, you can add the other stat to the damage as well.","x":500,"y":2857,"width":410,"height":188},
		{"id":"n-5-9","type":"text","text":"**[Arterial Spray]** \nWhen you would inflict the Bleeding (#) Condition, increase its Persist (#) by 1.","x":980,"y":2700,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-5-10","type":"text","text":"**[Heel Turn]** \nThe first time you Pivot during a round is free.","x":20,"y":2922,"width":410,"height":59},
		{"id":"n-6-3","type":"text","text":"**[Steady Feet II]** \nYou are immune to effects that would force you to move against your will.","x":980,"y":3412,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-5-12","type":"text","text":"**[Defensive Stance]** \nAs part of a Pivot, you can assume or drop a defensive stance. You no longer add your Strength or Dexterity to damage you deal; when you Block or Counter, you add your Strength or Dexterity to the damage you reduce or deal.","x":500,"y":3077,"width":410,"height":188},
		{"id":"n-5-4","type":"text","text":"**[En Garde]** \nYou can always Counter even if you have 0 AP; instead, suffer the Dazed Condition with Persist (1).","x":500,"y":2356,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-5-0","type":"text","text":"**[Strong Riposte]** \nWhen you Critically succeed the first roll of a Counter, you automatically win the second Contest and roll double damage.","x":20,"y":2020,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-5-3","type":"text","text":"**[Counterplay]** \nIf you win a Counter, you can perform a Maneuver in place of the attack.","x":20,"y":2372,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-5-8","type":"text","text":"**[Serrated Strike - Maneuver]** \nYou swing to leave a grisly cut; on a failure, the target suffers the Bleeding (1) Condition with Persist (1).","x":20,"y":2684,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-5-1","type":"text","text":"**[Quick Riposte]** \nWhen choosing to Counter, you may use your Dexterity on the second roll in place of Strength.","x":500,"y":2036,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-5-6","type":"text","text":"**[Implacable]** \nIf you have AP, you can Counter rolls even from sides you aren't facing.","x":500,"y":2536,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-5-5","type":"text","text":"**[Warrior in a Garden]** \nIf you did not spend any AP on your turn to deal damage or perform Maneuvers, you make the second roll of all Counters with Advantage (1) until your next turn.","x":980,"y":2340,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-5-7","type":"text","text":"**[Distant Counter]** \nYou can Counter against an attack made outside your Reach, using the countered weapon's damage die.","x":980,"y":2520,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-5-2","type":"text","text":"**[Deep Cut]** \nIf the damage your Counter deals would inflict a Wound, the target also suffers the Bleeding (2) Condition with Persist (1).","x":500,"y":2180,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-4-8","type":"text","text":"**[Daunt]** \nAs an Interaction, you can expend 2 AP to dismay all targets within Earshot, making a Willpower vs. Willpower Contest; on a failure, each target suffers Disadvantage (1) on their next attack or defense.","x":980,"y":1500,"width":410,"height":188},
		{"id":"n-4-6","type":"text","text":"**[Rally]** \nAs an Interaction, you can expend 2 AP to grant all allies within Earshot Advantage (1) on their next attack or defense.","x":980,"y":1351,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-4-1","type":"text","text":"**[Inspiring]** \nAs an Interaction, you can expend 1 AP to grant 1 AP to a target within Earshot.","x":980,"y":1072,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"c66bad6346a811de","type":"text","text":"**[Daring Riposte]**\nAfter succeeding a Counter, you can instead deal the damage to a different target within reach.","x":980,"y":2032,"width":410,"height":99},
		{"id":"n-3-1","type":"text","text":"**[Marathon]** \nIf all your available AP in a turn is spent on Movement, double the number of Paces you would move.","x":500,"y":456,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-2-1","type":"text","text":"**[Shove - Maneuver]** \nYou can perform this Maneuver when attempting to move through a target's space rather than attacking; on a failure, you move the target 1 Pace horizontally in a direction of your choice.","x":500,"y":-220,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-2-2","type":"text","text":"**[Rush]** \nWhen you forcibly move a target, you can make an attack against them without expending AP. This attack ends your movement.","x":1440,"y":-204,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"6ff8af4d2d4e61b7","type":"text","text":"**[Balanced Grip]** \nWeapons you wield with Reach take up one less Encumbrance, to a minimum of Bulk (1).","x":500,"y":-3,"width":410,"height":82},
		{"id":"n-2-5","type":"text","text":"**[Adjust Grip]** \nYou can wield Heavy weapons in one hand.","x":980,"y":-3,"width":410,"height":59},
		{"id":"n-2-4","type":"text","text":"**[In Extremis]** \nWhen you roll Strength to attack, you deal additional damage equal to the amount of Wounds in your Encumbrance.","x":980,"y":117,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-4-3","type":"text","text":"**[Changeling's Luck II]** \nAfter Critically succeeding a roll, you are immune to Critical hits until the end of the next round.","x":500,"y":1195,"width":410,"height":114},
		{"id":"n-4-2","type":"text","text":"**[Changeling's Luck I]** \nAfter Critically rolling an attack, you are immune to Critical hits until the end of your next turn.","x":20,"y":1206,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-4-4","type":"text","text":"**[Monologue]** \nYour word limit is doubled in combat.","x":20,"y":1381,"width":410,"height":59},
		{"id":"n-4-9","type":"text","text":"**[Stall]** \nAs an Interaction, you can expend 2 AP to make a Willpower vs. Willpower contest against a target within earshot; on a failure, their turn is moved to the end of the initiative order.","x":980,"y":1720,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-4-7","type":"text","text":"**[Castigate]** \nAs an Interaction, you can expend 1 AP to demoralize a target within Earshot, making a Willpower vs. Willpower Contest; on a failure, they suffer Disadvantage (1) on their next attack or defense.","x":500,"y":1500,"width":410,"height":188},
		{"id":"n-4-5","type":"text","text":"**[Rile]** \nAs an Interaction, you can expend 1 AP to motivate a target within Earshot, granting them Advantage (1) on their next attack or defense.","x":500,"y":1351,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-4-0","type":"text","text":"**[Fellowship]** \nAs an Interaction, you can expend 1 AP to Help an ally at a range up to Paces (5) during combat.","x":20,"y":1061,"width":410,"height":114},
		{"id":"n-3-2","type":"text","text":"**[Fleetfoot]** \nYou move an additional Pace when you Evade.","x":20,"y":624,"width":410,"height":59},
		{"id":"n-3-4","type":"text","text":"**[Alacrity]** \nYou gain AP at the start of the round, rather than the start of your turn.","x":20,"y":720,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-3-7","type":"text","text":"**[Haste III]** \nYour base Speed is further increased by 1, for a total of 3.","x":980,"y":835,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-3-8","type":"text","text":"**[Haste IV]** \nYour base Speed is further increased by 1, for a total of 4.","x":1440,"y":835,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-3-5","type":"text","text":"**[Haste I]** \nYour base Speed is increased by 1.","x":20,"y":851,"width":410,"height":59},
		{"id":"n-3-6","type":"text","text":"**[Haste II]** \nYour base Speed is further increased by 1, for a total of 2.","x":500,"y":835,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-3-3","type":"text","text":"**[Uncanny Swiftness]** \nThe first time in a round you Block, Evade, or Counter, you expend 0 AP.","x":980,"y":608,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"cf026dba7078b0fa","type":"text","text":"**[Haste V]** \nYour base Speed is further increased by 1, for a total of 5.","x":1940,"y":835,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-2-3","type":"text","text":"**[Reckless Strike]** \nAs a free Interaction, you can choose to roll damage you deal during your turn with Advantage (1); all damage dealt to you until your next turn is rolled with Advantage (1).","x":20,"y":-40,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-2-0","type":"text","text":"**[Trample]** \nDamage dealt by your forced movement ending early is increased by one die size.","x":20,"y":-188,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-20-0","type":"text","text":"**[Unstoppable Blows]** \nWhen attacking with a Flail, you ignore the Defensive property of the target's Equipment.","x":20,"y":13936,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-20-2","type":"text","text":"**[Tie-Up]** \nWhen using a Flail, you can perform the Grapple Maneuver; targets grappled this way suffer the Tethered (#) Condition, with (#) being your distance when you performed the maneuver.","x":500,"y":14059,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-19-0","type":"text","text":"**[Quickdraw]** \nWhen you draw your Dagger at the start of combat, you can immediately make an attack with it before anyone has taken their turn without expending AP.","x":20,"y":13189,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-19-3","type":"text","text":"**[Ransom]** \nWhen attacking an adjacent target with a Dagger, you can perform the Grapple Maneuver; grapples performed this way deal the Dagger's damage against a target attempting to break free and inflict the Bleeding (1) Condition with Persist (1).","x":20,"y":13373,"width":410,"height":188},
		{"id":"n-19-1","type":"text","text":"**[Double Stab]** \nWhen attacking with a Dagger, you can choose to make the attack at Disadvantage (1). You can then make an additional attack against the same target at Disadvantage (1) without expending AP.","x":1000,"y":13180,"width":410,"height":171},
		{"id":"n-19-5","type":"text","text":"**[Hamstring - Maneuver]** \nYou embed your Dagger at a lethal junction; your Dagger is lodged in the target until they use 3 AP to perform an Interaction to remove it. While the Dagger is embedded, whenever the target would move more than half their Speed in a turn, they suffer a Minor Wound.\n\n","x":500,"y":13561,"width":410,"height":213},
		{"id":"n-3-0","type":"text","text":"**[Inertia]** \nYou can take Movement equal to your Speed after reducing a target to 0 HP, without expending AP.","x":20,"y":460,"width":410,"height":114},
		{"id":"n-2-6","type":"text","text":"**[Blockade]** \nIf a creature would move through a space adjacent to you, you can expend 1 AP to initiate a Strength vs. Strength Contest; on a failure, the target's movement immediately ends.","x":20,"y":160,"width":410,"height":160},
		{"id":"n-20-1","type":"text","text":"**[Swing Around]** \nYou swing your Flail in the target's blindspot, you can spend 1 additional AP to make an attack as if you were directly behind the target.","x":1000,"y":13920,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-19-4","type":"text","text":"**[Bleedout]** \nWhen you inflict the Bleeding (#) Condition, it is always 1 higher.","x":1460,"y":13421,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-22-2","type":"text","text":"**[Point-Blank Shot]** \nWhen using a Crossbow, you can ignore the minimum range of your weapon.","x":500,"y":14932,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-21-0","type":"text","text":"**[Longshot I]** \nWhen using a Bow, you can choose to attack at up to twice the listed range at Disadvantage (1).","x":500,"y":14340,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-21-4","type":"text","text":"**[Nocked Arrow]** \nYou can spend 1 AP to Threaten a target within range of your Bow until the end of the next round.","x":500,"y":14500,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"16119b1930109c77","type":"text","text":"**[Volley]** \nIf a target you are Threatening with your Bow takes the Move action, you can make an attack against them before it resolves.","x":960,"y":14500,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"03ea185ddfe36015","type":"text","text":"**[Longshot II]** \nWhen using a Bow, you can choose to attack at up to thrice the listed range at Disadvantage (1).","x":1460,"y":14340,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-21-3","type":"text","text":"**[Aimed Shot]** \nWhen using a Bow weapon, you can perform the Disarm and Trip Maneuver with it.","x":20,"y":14516,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-22-0","type":"text","text":"**[Hotswap]** \nAfter successfully using a Contraption, you can immediately swap to a Crossbow and make an attack without expending AP.","x":20,"y":14740,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-22-1","type":"text","text":"**[Piercing Shot]** \nWhen using a Crossbow, Defenders cannot benefit from Partially Covered against your attacks, so long as the terrain is Hardness (1) or less.","x":20,"y":14900,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-1-11","type":"text","text":"**[Iron Slab]** \nYour Heavy weapons gain the Defensive property against all attacks, without reducing the damage die.","x":980,"y":-460,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-1-9","type":"text","text":"**[Bloodgilt]** \nIf you are not wearing armor, you gain DR to typed damage equal to the number of Wounds in your Encumbrance.","x":980,"y":-600,"width":410,"height":122},
		{"id":"n-1-5","type":"text","text":"**[Endurance II]** \nYour HP total is further increased by 3, for a total of 5.","x":1440,"y":-736,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-1-4","type":"text","text":"**[Endurance I]** \nYour HP total is increased by 2.","x":500,"y":-720,"width":410,"height":59},
		{"id":"n-1-2","type":"text","text":"**[Iron Will]** \nWhile wearing full armor (upper, middle, lower), you use your lowest DR against untyped damage.","x":500,"y":-880,"width":410,"height":114},
		{"id":"n-1-3","type":"text","text":"**[Steel Will]** \nWhile wearing full armor (upper, middle, lower), you use your highest DR against untyped damage.","x":980,"y":-884,"width":410,"height":122},
		{"id":"n-1-0","type":"text","text":"**[Impenetrable]**\nWhile wearing full armor (upper, middle, lower), you gain 1 DR against all damage types.","x":20,"y":-1020,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-1-1","type":"text","text":"**[Well-Fitted]** \nOne piece of armor you are wearing takes up one less Encumbrance, to a minimum of Bulk (1).","x":500,"y":-1020,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-0-6","type":"text","text":"**[Imitation]** \nAs an Interaction, you can expend 3 AP to learn any 1 EXP Ability from a target within Eyesight. You can use this ability until the end of the encounter.","x":1940,"y":-1280,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-1-10","type":"text","text":"**[Gutsy]** \nYour Heavy weapons gain the Defensive property against attacks made outside your Reach, without reducing the damage die.","x":500,"y":-460,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-1-8","type":"text","text":"**[Thick Skin]** \nIf you are not wearing armor, you gain DR to typed damage equal to the number of scars in your Encumbrance.","x":20,"y":-600,"width":410,"height":122},
		{"id":"5712d2973adf9c18","type":"text","text":"**[Disable - Maneuver]** \nYou compromise the target’s stance; on a failure, they cannot use Maneuvers this round.","x":20,"y":-1389,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-0-4","type":"text","text":"**[Momentum]** \nWhenever you Push a roll, you also grant yourself Advantage (1).","x":500,"y":-1480,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-0-5","type":"text","text":"**[Tireless]** \nThe first time in a day you would gain Fatigue during combat, you ignore it.","x":980,"y":-1480,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-0-2","type":"text","text":"**[Shout]** \nAs an Interaction, you can expend 1 AP to steel the resolve of a target within Earshot. They gain the Partially Covered Condition with Persist (1).","x":500,"y":-1660,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-0-1","type":"text","text":"**[Brace]**\nAs an Interaction, you can expend 1 AP to give yourself the Partially Covered Condition with Persist (1).","x":20,"y":-1660,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"090c0e78c2b0fda0","type":"text","text":"**[Focus]** \nAs an Interaction, you can expend 1 AP to reduce the Persist of the Unsteady and Dazed Conditions by 1.","x":20,"y":-1820,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"497d0936a1587d36","type":"text","text":"<div class=\"centered\">\n\n## EXP Cost: 2\n\n</div>","x":500,"y":-2040,"width":410,"height":100},
		{"id":"a6ae4ce4a873c99d","type":"text","text":"<div class=\"centered\">\n\n## EXP Cost: 3\n\n</div>","x":980,"y":-2040,"width":410,"height":100},
		{"id":"e592d3a3f61f8072","type":"text","text":"<div class=\"centered\">\n\n## EXP Cost: 1\n\n</div>","x":20,"y":-2040,"width":410,"height":100},
		{"id":"2ddb96cdf012a57a","type":"text","text":"<div class=\"centered\">\n\n## EXP Cost: 4\n\n</div>","x":1460,"y":-2040,"width":410,"height":100},
		{"id":"0430e2d1c04c040e","type":"text","text":"<div class=\"centered\">\n\n## EXP Cost: 5\n\n</div>","x":1940,"y":-2040,"width":410,"height":100},
		{"id":"n-23-0","type":"text","text":"**[Drakesblood]** \nPre-requisite: Aardayni. \nThe Persist (#) for Freezing and Burning Conditions cannot be higher than 1.","x":20,"y":15180,"width":410,"height":140},
		{"id":"n-23-1","type":"text","text":"**[Hymnary]** \nPre-requisite: Lagainian. \nTheurgy Spells you cast are always considered Complexity (1).","x":20,"y":15360,"width":410,"height":140},
		{"id":"n-23-2","type":"text","text":"**[Chevalier]** \nPre-requisite: Tousavi. \nWhen enemies make Morale Saves, they are done at Disadvantage (2).","x":20,"y":15540,"width":410,"height":140},
		{"id":"n-23-3","type":"text","text":"**[Binder]** \nPre-requisite: Marathan. \nYou roll with Advantage (1) for Willpower Contests against spells.","x":20,"y":15720,"width":410,"height":142},
		{"id":"n-24-0","type":"text","text":"**[Swift as Wind]** \nPre-requisite: Revolutionary Army. \nWhen attacking while wielding two weapons, you can expend 1 additional AP to make a second attack with the other. You roll for both of these attacks at the same time; the target can only Counter, Block, or Evade one of them.","x":20,"y":15980,"width":410,"height":213},
		{"id":"n-24-1","type":"text","text":"**[Strong as Tide]** \nPre-requisite: Revolutionary Army. \nWhen attacking with a Two-Handed weapon, you can expend 1 additional AP to batter down their defenses. The next attack made against them has Advantage (2).","x":500,"y":16240,"width":410,"height":188},
		{"id":"n-24-2","type":"text","text":"**[Malefica]** \nPre-requisite: Revolutionary Army. \nWhen you Cast, you can expend 1 additional AP to roll the Willpower Contest with Advantage (1).","x":980,"y":16460,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-24-3","type":"text","text":"**[Empty Heaven]** \nPre-requisite: Furnace of Man. \nReduce the AP cost of all your spells by 1.","x":980,"y":16620,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-13-1","type":"text","text":"**[Cleave]** \nWhen your Sword reduces a target to 0 HP, you may redirect the excess damage to another target within reach without rolling to hit.","x":500,"y":9821,"width":410,"height":113}
	],
